WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.536
-A massive college
cheating scandal

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:06.005
and the sentencing of the
president's ex-campaign chairman

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.341
have exposed corruption at
the highest levels of society.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.010
For more on this, it's time for
"A Closer Look."

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.415
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:18.217
The past 24 hours have really
pulled back the curtain

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:20.353
on how wealth and power
operate in America.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.855
Yesterday, a $25 million
college-admissions

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:25.091
cheating scandal
ensnared Hollywood actors

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.559
and some of the wealthiest
people in the country.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:29.828
And today, the president's
campaign chairman was indicted

00:00:29.828 --> 00:00:33.366
in one case for fraud,
and sentenced in another case

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.369
after he was already sentenced
last week in a third case,

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.437
in which he was accused
of stealing money

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:41.140
and spending it on a jacket
made from an ostrich.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.274
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:45.411
In other words,
rich people are insane.

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:48.281
Once you have that much money,
it poisons your brain.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.383
You either end up
bribing a soccer coach

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.550
to get your kid
into Yale,

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.585
or, if that doesn't work,

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:55.221
you leave all your money
to your cat --

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.523
which is a ridiculous
thing to do,

00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:59.258
since every cat
already acts

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:00.660
like they have
"[bleep] you" money.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.861
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.429
"Good news!"

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.530
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:08.033
"Good news, cat,
you're a millionaire."

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.270
"You mean
I wasn't already?"

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.537
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.607
"I'm pretty sure
I already was."

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.776
But Paul Manafort
really had the worst day,

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.011
because right after
he was sentenced in one case,

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:22.014
he was indicted by a different
office in another case

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:24.850
involving 16 counts tied to
residential-mortgage fraud.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.453
He was sentenced and indicted
on the same day

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:31.657
in a move that will one day
be coined "The Manafort."

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:33.292
But the college-admissions
cheating scandal

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:34.827
is one of the most
fascinating glimpses

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:36.763
into how the wealthy and
the privileged rig the game.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.898
More than 40 people have been
arrested in the scheme,

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.633
including everyone
from C.E.O.s,

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.602
to the heads of major
international law firms,

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.771
to private-equity titans,
to Hollywood actors.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.040
-Federal prosecutors today
revealed what they say

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.742
is the largest case of
college-admissions fraud

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:53.312
in U.S. history, charging
coaches and affluent parents --

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:56.749
including Hollywood elite --
in a massive bribery scheme

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.818
to fast-track kids
into some of the country's

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.921
top universities,
including Yale and Stanford.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.323
-The fraud,
allegedly two-fold --

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:05.758
parents paying
to inflate

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.994
their children's
standardized test scores,

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:11.030
or faking athletic records
to get students recruited

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.065
for sports they did
not even play.

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:14.767
-Two Hollywood actresses

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.203
are among the dozens
of people charged --

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.440
the TV stars Felicity Huffman
from "Desperate Housewives,"

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.808
and Lori Loughlin
from "Full House."

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:24.243
-Lori Loughlin?

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.579
Why didn't you just bribe
a college the normal way,

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.314
by donating money
for a new building?

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.750
You already had
a name.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.885
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:36.656
The details of this scandal
are truly mind-blowing.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:39.292
For example, parents bribed
coaches at prestigious schools

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.127
to get their kids admitted
as athletes

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.962
in sports
they didn't play.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:45.264
In one case, the teenage girl
who did not play soccer

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:47.367
magically became a star
soccer recruit at Yale

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.102
in exchange
for $400,000.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:52.504
Now, that $400,000
went to the Yale coach,

00:02:52.504 --> 00:02:55.475
who was in on the scam,
and then had to, I guess,

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:58.344
explain what they saw
in the new recruit.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:02:59.412
"All right, everybody.
Gather around.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:00.647
This is our new
star player.

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:02.315
You're not gonna see much of her
out on the field,

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:04.550
but wait until you try
her orange slices."

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.585
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.585 --> 00:03:09.188
Some parents,
including Loughlin,

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.056
even went to
the extraordinary lengths

00:03:11.056 --> 00:03:13.693
of staging or doctoring photos
to make it look like

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:16.062
their kids were playing sports
they did not play.

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:19.131
-Investigators say
Lori Loughlin and her husband

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:22.302
agreed to pay bribes
totaling half a million dollars

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.670
in exchange for having
their two daughters

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.673
designated as recruits
to the USC crew team,

00:03:27.673 --> 00:03:31.344
despite the fact that they
did not participate in crew.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:33.912
Court documents say
they even had their girls

00:03:33.912 --> 00:03:36.249
stage photos
as athletes.

00:03:36.249 --> 00:03:39.151
-In one instance,
a parent sending this photo

00:03:39.151 --> 00:03:41.954
showing their daughter playing
water polo in high school,

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:45.324
but in fact,
the photo was another student.

00:03:45.324 --> 00:03:47.359
-I mean, of all the sports
to lie about,

00:03:47.359 --> 00:03:49.495
I have to say,
water polo is the smartest one,

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.330
because nobody knows
how it works.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.598
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:56.236
I don't even know what a
water-polo body would look like.

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:59.072
I mean, is it long arms
and a tail?

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.539
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.539 --> 00:04:02.942
Of course,
the plan would have worked,

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:05.010
until the kid
showed up at the pool

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.979
in riding gear
and an actual horse.

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:09.248
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:11.917
Now, there's already all kinds
of normalized, accepted

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:14.153
pay-to-play in
the college-entry process,

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:16.121
from expensive
test-prep classes,

00:04:16.121 --> 00:04:19.391
to legacy admissions, to just
writing a massive check --

00:04:19.391 --> 00:04:21.628
which is also known as
"institutional advancement."

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:23.495
But the guy who set up
this scheme --

00:04:23.495 --> 00:04:25.097
a businessman named
William Singer --

00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:27.300
explained in court that
he was giving wealthy parents

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.935
a way to get around
all of that.

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:31.103
-In one phone called,
authorities listened

00:04:31.103 --> 00:04:34.006
as Singer told one parent
how it all worked,

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:35.908
saying,
"There's a front door,

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:37.643
which means you get in
on your own.

00:04:37.643 --> 00:04:40.379
The back door is through
institutional advancement,

00:04:40.379 --> 00:04:42.648
which is 10 times
as much money.

00:04:42.648 --> 00:04:45.317
And I've created
the side door."

00:04:45.317 --> 00:04:46.619
-Imagine having
enough money

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:49.388
to legally bribe your kids's way
into an elite college,

00:04:49.388 --> 00:04:51.557
and thinking, "How about,
instead, we Photoshop his head

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:52.992
onto Michael Phelps' body?"

00:04:52.992 --> 00:04:55.527
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.527 --> 00:04:57.630
And make no mistake,
the parents in these cases

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.164
were very aware
of what they were doing.

00:04:59.164 --> 00:05:01.300
The FBI released one e-mail
written by Huffman

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.236
when she found out
that her daughter's school

00:05:03.236 --> 00:05:05.904
would provide their own
SAT proctor,

00:05:05.904 --> 00:05:07.106
making it harder
to cheat.

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:09.609
She wrote --
and this is a real e-mail --

00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:10.976
"Ruh-roh.

00:05:10.976 --> 00:05:12.879
Look like
my daughter's high school

00:05:12.879 --> 00:05:15.281
wants to provide
own proctor."

00:05:15.281 --> 00:05:18.050
She literally sat down
at a computer

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.919
and typed the word
"Ruh-roh"...

00:05:19.919 --> 00:05:21.020
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:24.223
...making this --
making this the rare case

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:27.326
where Scooby Doo
was the criminal.

00:05:27.326 --> 00:05:29.095
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:31.597
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:33.099
This scandal...

00:05:35.434 --> 00:05:37.703
[ As Shaggy ]
"It was you, Scoob."

00:05:37.703 --> 00:05:38.971
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:40.005
[ Normal voice ]
This scandal might be

00:05:40.005 --> 00:05:41.707
the most glaring example
of pay-to-play

00:05:41.707 --> 00:05:43.743
in college admissions,
but it's not the only one.

00:05:43.743 --> 00:05:45.010
There's already
lots of pay-to-play

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.845
in the college-admissions world
that's legal.

00:05:46.845 --> 00:05:49.081
I mean, just look at the
President of the United States.

00:05:49.081 --> 00:05:51.617
He went to Wharton, one of
the most prestigious schools

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:53.319
in the country,
and he doesn't even know

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:55.421
how to spell the word
"country."

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:56.789
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.789 --> 00:05:58.790
And if you asked him to spell
the word "prestigious,"

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.794
the red squiggle would just
give up and crawl away.

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:04.830
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:05.898
[ Gun cocks ]

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:07.066
[ Gunshot ]

00:06:07.066 --> 00:06:09.035
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:10.969
And let's not forget,
this is a guy who famously

00:06:10.969 --> 00:06:13.038
waged a racist campaign
to get President Obama

00:06:13.038 --> 00:06:14.607
to release his
college transcripts,

00:06:14.607 --> 00:06:15.974
despite the fact that,
as we learned

00:06:15.974 --> 00:06:17.477
from Michael Cohen's
testimony,

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:19.712
Trump threatened his own schools
not to release

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.247
his grades
and test scores.

00:06:21.247 --> 00:06:25.551
-I'm talking about a man who
declares himself "brilliant,"

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:29.821
but directed me to threaten
his high school, his colleges,

00:06:29.821 --> 00:06:31.624
and the College Board

00:06:31.624 --> 00:06:35.728
to never release his grades
or SAT scores.

00:06:35.728 --> 00:06:38.164
-I shudder to imagine
what Trump's SAT score was.

00:06:38.164 --> 00:06:39.798
It was probably
the first time in history

00:06:39.798 --> 00:06:41.667
the College Board
wrote on someone's test,

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:43.402
"It's better if
you don't know."

00:06:43.402 --> 00:06:45.271
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:46.806
The culture...

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:49.542
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:51.744
The culture of inequality
and pay-to-play

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:53.512
at the highest levels
of American society

00:06:53.512 --> 00:06:55.815
has been on full display
over the last 24 hours.

00:06:55.815 --> 00:06:58.284
From serial fraud
committed by wealthy parents

00:06:58.284 --> 00:07:00.886
to serial fraud committed by the
president's campaign chairman,

00:07:00.886 --> 00:07:03.656
people are finally getting
a glimpse at how it all works.

00:07:03.656 --> 00:07:06.659
And they're all saying, in
the words of Felicity Huffman...

00:07:06.659 --> 00:07:07.827
-"Ruh-roh."

00:07:07.827 --> 00:07:10.196
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:07:10.196 --> 00:07:12.899
[ Cheers and applause ]

